Query guidance: use Gmail-style operators (from:, to:, subject:, is:unread, has:attachment, newer_than:1d, after:/before:). For topic or digest requests, prefer recency (newer_than:1d) and/or sender (from:) filters over subject: keyword filtering: subjects don't reliably contain the topic word, and when filtering by subject/body cover synonyms rather than over-filtering one term. Date bounds after:/before: take a plain date with no time component (before:2026/05/08 or before:2026-05-08); a time component is not valid Gmail syntax and silently returns nothing.

